model {
  extend basalt.toolsGateway {
    metadata {
      constraint "Deployment activation commits its scoped revision and pending notification in the writer transaction. Retried delivery uses the existing background jobs and app-data supervisor sockets, never a transport ordinal as a durable cursor. Subscription registration precedes the authoritative revision handshake. Every private event checks current session, membership and app authority; snapshot responses cannot replace a newer acknowledged revision. This foundation removes no timer. Links, credentials, groups, roles, sharing, session writers, collection and time-driven expiry remain uncovered until their own conversions."
    }
  }
}
